    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0611","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ásdís Nakamura talks about a square that refuses to be a square. The artist asked that the microphone face away from the painting, so as not to influence it.</Description>
